---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Inspect environments

Usage: rustman env [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List the workspace's environments, marking the active one with '*'
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
